DeckyEQ is an independent Decky Loader plugin by Rayek.

The release checker, verified ZIP downloader and update interface are adapted
from Rayekkk/SpotiDeck and Rayekkk/LegionGo2Companion, under BSD-3-Clause; the
dk_*.py modules are shared with the author's other Decky plugins.
Copyright (c) 2026 Rayekkk. See LICENSE.

The production JavaScript bundle incorporates @decky/api 1.1.3, licensed under
LGPL-2.1. Its license and the complete installed package source are included in
the distribution's third_party/decky-api directory.
DeckyEQ's TypeScript source, lockfile and build configuration are included so
the bundle can be rebuilt with a modified API package.

React and @decky/ui are supplied by Decky/Steam at runtime, not redistributed
as part of DeckyEQ's production bundle. Development-only preview and test
dependencies are not included in the plugin ZIP.

PipeWire is an existing system component. DeckyEQ distributes configuration
and a control client, not PipeWire binaries or third-party audio effect plugins.
`bin/deckyeq_dsp.so` is DeckyEQ's own LADSPA stage (level, width, boost and
limiter), built from `native/deckyeq_dsp.c` under DeckyEQ's BSD 3-Clause license.
The graph follows the public PipeWire filter-chain API and the upstream
sink-eq6 example. No Lenovo or Nahimic assets or presets are included.

The numeric community preset "Legion Go S · Original" is attributed to GAZuOOT.
Source, original file hashes, actual PipeWire parsing behavior and parameter
mapping are documented in docs/GO_S_PRESET.md. The original configuration file
and archive are not redistributed; the preset uses DeckyEQ's own JSON format.

